<title>USA: Chrysler August US car sales fall.</title>
<headline>Chrysler August US car sales fall.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chrysler Corp</p>
<p>			Aug 1-31, 1996     Aug 1-31, 1995 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	    58,255	    59,408	     -1.9</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	 127,870	   109,536	    +16.7</p>
<p> Import Car		   181	     1,613	    -88.8</p>
<p> Import Truck		   0		   0	     N.A.</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-Aug 31, 1996 Jan 1-Aug 31, 1995 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	   599,955	   556,745	     +6.7</p>
<p> Domestic Truck     1,098,493	   918,023	    +18.5</p>
<p> Import Car		 3,889	    10,872	    -64.6</p>
<p> Import Truck		   0		   0	     N.A.</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 27 in latest month vs 27, 207 for year to date vs 205 in year ago.</p>
</text>
